p = english_pack("form1-english", 1,
    "A first-year secondary English course: nouns, pronouns, present and past tenses, adjectives and adverbs, prepositions and conjunctions, punctuation, word building, a first reading comprehension, an informal letter and oral English, with Cameroonian examples and original exercises.",
    "Cameroon secondary school English Language, Form 1 (anglophone sub-system) — scope and order to be checked against the official programme and the class textbook")

